<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
  <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

  <parent>
    <groupId>com.recalltree</groupId>
    <artifactId>recalltree-parent</artifactId>
    <version>0.1.0-SNAPSHOT</version>
  </parent>

  <artifactId>recalltree-architecture-tests</artifactId>
  <name>RecallTree Architecture Tests</name>
  <description>ADR-001 依赖方向的断言。

    这个模块单独存在是有原因的：架构规则必须能同时看到全部五个模块才能真正生效。
    如果把规则放在 api 模块里，evaluation 不在其 classpath 上，
    "evaluation 不得依赖 api" 这条规则会因为匹配不到任何类而静默空跑——
    看起来通过，实际上从未校验。ArchUnit 的 failOnEmptyShould 会暴露这种假通过。</description>

  <dependencies>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.recalltree</groupId>
      <artifactId>recalltree-domain</artifactId>
      <scope>test</scope>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.recalltree</groupId>
      <artifactId>recalltree-application</artifactId>
      <scope>test</scope>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.recalltree</groupId>
      <artifactId>recalltree-infrastructure</artifactId>
      <scope>test</scope>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.recalltree</groupId>
      <artifactId>recalltree-api</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
      <scope>test</scope>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.recalltree</groupId>
      <artifactId>recalltree-evaluation</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
      <scope>test</scope>
    </dependency>

    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.tngtech.archunit</groupId>
      <artifactId>archunit-junit5</artifactId>
      <scope>test</scope>
    </dependency>
  </dependencies>

  <build>
    <plugins>
      <!--
        这个模块只有测试代码，没有 main 源码，默认会打出空 jar 并告警。
        它也不需要被任何模块依赖，因此跳过打包。
      -->
      <plugin>
        <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
        <artifactId>maven-jar-plugin</artifactId>
        <executions>
          <execution>
            <id>default-jar</id>
            <phase>none</phase>
          </execution>
        </executions>
      </plugin>
      <plugin>
        <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
        <artifactId>maven-install-plugin</artifactId>
        <configuration>
          <skip>true</skip>
        </configuration>
      </plugin>
    </plugins>
  </build>
</project>
